5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m here to make sure we don’t just shuffle the mess to someone else’s doorstep.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We need to understand the daily reality of each option before we commit.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the costs. We haven’t added up what this corner already costs us every year, or what a fix would take.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m mostly worried about how we’ll get along after this. We still have to live here together, so let’s keep that in mind.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I have watched arrangements here rest on whoever answers the phone first. I want to know, in hours, what this one takes from us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
