38,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@May, the log confirms the gate household’s pain. But the meeting showed nobody wants to enforce rules. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on us policing each other.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
